{"id":977630,"shortDescription":"Shelter 3 te invita a explorar la vida en la jungla; un mundo repleto de bestias gigantes y vegetación exótica. Ponte en la piel de un elefante que viaja junto a su familia en busca de ríos y canales mientras cuida de los elefantes más jóvenes y aprende de los mayores. Recuerda que tienes que comer, así que ¡no dejes de moverte!","developers":["Might and Delight"],"publishers":["Might and Delight"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"30 MAR 2021","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747743267","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/ss_60898e183c1d5616d2a732562e3385583fed05b3.600x338.jpg?t=1747743267","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/ss_60898e183c1d5616d2a732562e3385583fed05b3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747743267"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/ss_30081ddc59d2d97f6bb16bf3ccdd7354d44d1a2f.600x338.jpg?t=1747743267","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/ss_30081ddc59d2d97f6bb16bf3ccdd7354d44d1a2f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747743267"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/ss_f4c1e4b8e714246fa0d6f38fb28d2c60f91fad8f.600x338.jpg?t=1747743267","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/ss_f4c1e4b8e714246fa0d6f38fb28d2c60f91fad8f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747743267"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/ss_34f29255b9eeb1cefe6c7f7d10b9f6d7dbb01509.600x338.jpg?t=1747743267","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/ss_34f29255b9eeb1cefe6c7f7d10b9f6d7dbb01509.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747743267"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/ss_fd82ffacf2e8